                    <item>PART 1<list>
                            <item>I. Continuing participation of the United States in the North
                                Atlantic Treaty Organization:<list>
                                    <item>A. Participation by the United States in the Ninth Session
                                        of the North Atlantic Council, Lisbon, February 20–25, 1952,
                                        and the meetings of the Foreign Ministers in London,
                                        February 13–19, and Lisbon, February 20–26, 1952:<list>
                                            <item>
                                                <ref target="#pg1">1. Arrangements and preparations
                                                  for the Ninth Session of the North Atlantic
                                                  Council in Lisbon and the meetings of the Foreign
                                                  Ministers in London and Lisbon</ref>
