                                                  continuing negotiation of a Saar Agreement</ref>
                                            </item>
                                        </list>
                                    </item>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="frus:frus1952-54v05p2/pg_1464">E. Efforts to
                                            encourage ratification of the Paris Agreements and the
                                            Saar Agreement, October 24–December 31, 1954</ref>
                                    </item>
                                </list>
